msgstr "只是風而已。天花板那個聲音明明有節奏。"

#. Key:	WitnessRoofWindThoughtFirstEvening
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(1794)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(1794)
