msgstr "看402室門上貼的紙條"

#. Key:	Arrival402Thought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2001)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2001)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Arrival402Thought"
msgid "새벽마다 위에서 뭘 끄는 소리가 납니다. 혹시 같은 소리 들으시면 관리실에 말씀해 주세요. 402호"
msgstr "每天凌晨樓上都有拖東西的聲音。如果您也有聽到，麻煩跟管理室反映。402室"

#. Key:	ArrivalRoofLockPrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2033)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2033)
