#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2292)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NarinDeliveryQuestion"
msgid "뒤에 붙은 택배 안내문 보고 왔는데요. 백도하 앞으로 온 택배도 여기 맡긴 적 있어요?"
msgstr "我看到後面貼的宅配告示。請問寄給白道夏的包裹，有寄放在這裡過嗎？"

#. Key:	NarinRoofQuestion
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2294)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2294)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NarinRoofQuestion"
msgid "저희 빌라 옥상 문이요, 원래 잠가 둬요? 자물쇠가 채워져 있던데."
msgstr "我們公寓頂樓的門，平常都鎖著嗎？我看上面掛了鎖。"

#. Key:	NarinRepeatQuestion
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2297)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2297)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NarinRepeatQuestion"
msgid "혹시 생각나는 게 더 있으세요?"
msgstr "妳還有想到什麼嗎？"

#. Key:	NarinFirstQuestion
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2298)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2298)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NarinFirstQuestion"
msgid "달빛빌라 403호에 이사 왔어요. 백도하라는 사람 아세요? 제 오빠예요."
msgstr "我剛搬進月光公寓403室。妳認識一個叫白道夏的人嗎？他是我哥。"

#. Key:	NarinLaterQuestion
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2299)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2299)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NarinLaterQuestion"
msgid "저 왔어요. 혹시 그 뒤로 뭐 들으신 건 없어요?"
msgstr "我又來了。後來有聽到什麼消息嗎？"

#. Key:	NarinSpeaker
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2302)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2302)
