#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2332)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ArrivalContractPrintedRead"
msgid "지상 4층. 옥상은 같이 쓰되, 창고랑 기계실은 들어가지 말라고 돼 있네."
msgstr "地上四層。頂樓是共用的，但倉庫跟機房不能進去。"

#. Key:	Arrival402VacantThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2355)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2355)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Arrival402VacantThought"
msgid "빈집이라더니. 메모만 붙어 있네."
msgstr "不是說沒人住嗎？只有紙條還貼著。"

#. Key:	ArrivalRoofClinkCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2428)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2428)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ArrivalRoofClinkCaption"
msgid "쇠붙이 내려놓는 소리"
msgstr "放下鐵器的聲音"

#. Key:	ArrivalRoofRationalize
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2449)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2449)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ArrivalRoofRationalize"
msgid "창고에서 짐 정리하나 보네."
msgstr "大概是在倉庫整理東西吧。"

#. Key:	UsedListingMemoThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2606)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2606)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,UsedListingMemoThought"
msgid "관리실 책상 메모에 있던 그 거래네. 8월 12일, 3만 원."
msgstr "是管理室桌上便條寫的那筆交易。8月12日，3萬韓元。"

#. Key:	UsedListingThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2610)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2610)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,UsedListingThought"
msgid "오빠 공구랑 똑같다. 판 사람이… ‘달빛’?"
msgstr "跟哥的工具一模一樣。賣家的暱稱是……「月光」？"

#. Key:	RearDoorCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2635)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2635)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,RearDoorCaption"
msgid "철문 닫히는 소리"
msgstr "鐵門關上的聲音"

#. Key:	NarinDeliveryAnswer
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2645)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2645)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NarinDeliveryAnswer"
msgid "작년 여름에 몇 번 맡겼어요. 마지막 건 건물주 아저씨가 찾아가셨고요. 오빠분이 부탁했다고 하던데요."
msgstr "去年夏天寄放過幾次。最後那件是房東阿伯來領走的，他說是妳哥拜託他的。"

#. Key:	NarinLineLastDay
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2654)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2654)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NarinLineLastDay"
msgid "아직은요. 저 오늘도 밤새 있으니까, 무슨 일 있으면 바로 이쪽으로 오세요."
msgstr "還沒耶。我今天也整晚都在，有什麼事就直接過來喔。"

#. Key:	NarinLineRoof
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2663)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2663)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NarinLineRoof"
msgid "옥상요? 작년 여름에 건물주 아저씨가 자물쇠를 싹 바꿨대요. 열쇠는 관리실에나 있을걸요."
msgstr "頂樓喔？聽說去年夏天房東阿伯把鎖全換了。鑰匙大概只有管理室有吧。"

#. Key:	NarinLineMidWeek
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2670)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2670)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NarinLineMidWeek"
msgid "아직 소식 없으세요? 저도 단골들한테 물어봤는데, 최근에 봤다는 사람은 없더라고요."
msgstr "還沒有消息嗎？我也問過常客了，都說最近沒看到他。"

#. Key:	NarinRepeatAnswer
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2677)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2677)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NarinRepeatAnswer"
msgid "지금은 그 정도예요. 다른 손님들한테도 한번 물어볼게요."
msgstr "目前就知道這些。我再幫妳問問其他客人。"

#. Key:	ArrivalNarinLine
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2682)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2682)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ArrivalNarinLine"
msgid "아, 큰 가방 메고 다니시던 분? 작년 여름쯤부터 안 오시던데요. 403호로 오셨어요? 그 집은 올해만 벌써 세 번째네요. 옆집도 봄부터 비어 있고요."
msgstr "啊，是常提著大包包來的那位嗎？去年夏天之後就沒再看到了。403室今年已經換第三個房客了。隔壁402室春天搬走之後也一直空著。"

#. Key:	ArrivalObjectiveExplore
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2720)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(2720)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ArrivalObjectiveExplore"
msgid "짐 풀고 빌라와 편의점 둘러보기"
msgstr "整理行李，到公寓和便利商店四處看看"

#. Key:	ArrivalObjectiveContract
