#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4781)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401PeekCaption"
msgid "401호 문 살짝 열리는 소리"
msgstr "401室的門輕輕打開的聲音"

#. Key:	HwangSpeaker
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4817)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4817)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,HwangSpeaker"
msgid "황순금"
msgstr "黃順今"

#. Key:	Hwang401Peek
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4818)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4818)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401Peek"
msgid "새벽에 나와 있었죠? 들어가서 눈 좀 붙여요."
msgstr "妳凌晨在外面對吧？進去瞇一下。"

#. Key:	Hwang401Greeting
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4864)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4864)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401Greeting"
msgid "403호 새로 온 아가씨죠? 밤엔 문 좀 살살 닫아 줘요. 여기 소리가 잘 울려서."
msgstr "妳是新搬來403的吧？晚上關門輕一點，這棟樓很容易傳聲音。"

#. Key:	Hwang401HintP5
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4880)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4880)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401HintP5"
msgid "내일 아침에 또 벽을 막는대요. 물탱크 청소할 땐 배관 소리가 어찌나 큰지, 벽을 쳐도 안 들리던데."
msgstr "聽說明天早上又要把牆封起來。凌晨洗水塔的時候，水管會震得每面牆都在響，有人敲牆也沒人知道。"

#. Key:	Hwang401HintP4
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4888)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4888)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401HintP4"
msgid "벽이 하도 울길래 나도 똑같이 두드려 줬어요. 그랬더니 그날 밤은 조용하더라고요."
msgstr "牆一直響個不停，我也照樣敲了回去。結果那天晚上就安靜了。"

#. Key:	Hwang401HintP3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4896)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4896)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401HintP3"
msgid "관리인 없어요? 열쇠는 늘 책상 위에 두던데. 못 들어가게 하면 나한테 말해요."
msgstr "管理員不在嗎？他鑰匙都放在桌上的。不讓妳進去的話，跟我說。"

#. Key:	Hwang401AfterT7
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4904)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4904)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401AfterT7"
msgid "그날도 들었어요. 사람이 없다는데, 난 분명히 들었다니까요."
msgstr "那天我也聽到了。他們說那裡沒人，可是我真的聽到了。"

#. Key:	Hwang401HintP2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4915)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4915)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401HintP2"
msgid "몇 번을 전화했는데 맨날 배관 소리래요. 장부에 적기는 했나 좀 봐 줘요."
msgstr "我打去管理室說有聲音，都不知道打幾次了，他只說是水管。妳幫我看看他在紀錄簿上寫了什麼。"

#. Key:	Hwang401HintP1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4923)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4923)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401HintP1"
msgid "전기 나갔으면 1층 계량기함 봐요. 검침표도 거기 붙어 있어요."
msgstr "停電的話去看一樓的電錶箱。抄表紀錄也貼在那裡。"

#. Key:	Hwang401Neutral
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4930)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4930)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401Neutral"
msgid "잠은 좀 잤어요? 물이라도 한 잔 마시고 가요."
msgstr "有睡一下嗎？喝杯水再走吧。"

#. Key:	Arrival401PrayerStops
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4983)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(4983)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Arrival401PrayerStops"
msgid "안에서 들리던 불경 소리가 멈춘다"
msgstr "裡面的誦經聲停了"

#. Key:	Hwang401JournalGiven
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5066)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5066)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401JournalGiven"
msgid "문고리에 걸어 둔 거 읽어 봐요. 사람이 없다는데, 난 분명히 들었다니까요."
msgstr "我掛在門把上的東西，妳看看。他們說那裡沒人，可是我真的聽到了。"

#. Key:	YudamToHwangAnswer
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5120)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5120)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,YudamToHwangAnswer"
msgid "벽 안에서 대답이 왔어요. 둘, 쉬고, 하나. 오빠가 문 두드리던 박자예요."
msgstr "牆裡有回應了。兩下，停一下，再一下。是我哥以前敲門的節奏。"

#. Key:	Hwang401IsItYourBrother
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5130)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5130)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401IsItYourBrother"
msgid "그게 아가씨 오빠였어요?"
msgstr "小姐，那是妳哥哥嗎？"

#. Key:	Hwang401Permission
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5137)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5137)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401Permission"
msgid "꺼내 줘요. 물 필요하면 써요. 그깟 물값, 내가 낼 테니까."
msgstr "把他接出來吧。水塔的水儘管開，水費我來出。"

#. Key:	NightFourWallNeedsCover
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5193)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5193)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NightFourWallNeedsCover"
msgid "지금 치면 건물 사람들이 다 듣겠어. 소리를 덮을 게 필요해."
msgstr "現在敲的話，整棟的人都會聽到。得找個聲音蓋過去。"

#. Key:	SettlePipe
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(672)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(672)
msgctxt "IGNight,SettlePipe"
msgid "배관에서 딱 하는 소리"
msgstr "水管發出一聲脆響"

#. Key:	SettleCreak
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(678)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(678)
msgctxt "IGNight,SettleCreak"
msgid "나무 삐걱거리는 소리"
msgstr "木頭嘎吱作響的聲音"

#. Key:	SettleTick
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(682)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(682)
msgctxt "IGNight,SettleTick"
msgid "벽에 금 가는 소리"
msgstr "牆壁龜裂的聲音"

#. Key:	SettleSlam
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(686)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(686)
msgctxt "IGNight,SettleSlam"
msgid "멀리서 문 닫히는 소리"
msgstr "遠處關門的聲音"

#. Key:	DayObjectiveNotice
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(7844)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(7844)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,DayObjectiveNotice"
msgid "403호 문에 붙은 통보문 읽기"
msgstr "閱讀403門上貼的通知"

#. Key:	DayObjectiveReport
