msgstr "哥的工單還留在這裡。"

#. Key:	EpilogueWorkshop2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(755)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(755)
