msgstr "直立式鋼琴 1台  ·  收件人 白侑潭  ·  入厝前送達"

#. Key:	EpilogueWorkshop3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(760)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(760)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueWorkshop3"
msgid "튜닝 해머를 쥐어 본다. 손잡이 한쪽이 닳아 있다."
msgstr "握了握調音扳手。握柄有一側已經磨損了。"

#. Key:	EpilogueAutumn1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(771)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(771)
