msgstr "五樓正在拆除。吊車整天堵在巷子裡。"

#. Key:	EpilogueAutumn1Vacancy
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(780)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(780)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueAutumn1Vacancy"
msgid "402호에 불이 켜져 있다. 냉장고 소리가 복도까지 들린다."
msgstr "402室亮著燈。冰箱的聲音傳到了走廊上。"

#. Key:	EpilogueAutumn2Seen
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(789)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(789)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueAutumn2Seen"
msgid "물그릇이 있던 401호 앞을 지난다. 창턱에 작은 라디오가 놓여 있다."
msgstr "經過以前放著水碗的401室門口。窗台上擺著一台小收音機。"

#. Key:	EpilogueAutumn2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(796)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(796)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueAutumn2"
msgid "401호 창턱에 작은 라디오가 창밖을 향해 놓여 있다."
msgstr "401室的窗台上，一台小收音機朝著窗外擺著。"

#. Key:	EpilogueAutumn3Radio
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(806)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(806)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueAutumn3Radio"
msgid "문 너머로 듣던 그 불경 소리다. 창밖으로 들리게 틀어 놓으셨네."
msgstr "是以前隔著門聽到的那個誦經聲。阿嬤把它開著，讓窗外也聽得到。"

#. Key:	EpilogueAutumn3Seen
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(813)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(813)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueAutumn3Seen"
msgid "라디오를 창밖 쪽으로 돌려놓으셨다. 골목까지 들리겠다."
msgstr "阿嬤把收音機轉向窗外了。巷子裡應該也聽得到。"

#. Key:	EpilogueServiceBay1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(825)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(825)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueServiceBay1"
msgid "방수포도 카트도 치워졌다. 콘크리트에 자국만 남았다."
msgstr "防水布和推車都清走了。水泥地上只剩下痕跡。"

#. Key:	EpilogueServiceBay1b
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(830)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(830)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueServiceBay1b"
msgid "관리실 창은 그날 밤 뒤로 불이 한 번도 안 켜졌다."
msgstr "那晚之後，管理室的窗戶再也沒亮過燈。"

#. Key:	EpilogueServiceBay2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(836)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(836)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueServiceBay2"
msgid "그 뒤로 새벽 두 번을 401호 할머니와 벽 앞에서 같이 대답했다."
msgstr "之後又有兩個凌晨，我和401的阿嬤一起在牆前回應他。"

#. Key:	EpilogueServiceBay3Seen
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(843)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(843)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueServiceBay3Seen"
msgid "옥상 탱크 옆, 오빠가 쉬던 자리는 아직 그대로다."
msgstr "頂樓水塔旁邊，哥以前休息的地方還是老樣子。"

#. Key:	EpilogueServiceBay4
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(849)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(849)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueServiceBay4"
msgid "방을 빼고 403호 열쇠를 돌려줬다."
msgstr "退了租，把403室的鑰匙還回去了。"

#. Key:	EpilogueNews1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(863)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(863)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNews1"
msgid "무영로 다세대주택 벽체에서 남성 유해 발견 … 실종 1년 만"
msgstr "無影路公寓牆內發現男性遺骸…失蹤一年後尋獲"

#. Key:	EpilogueNewsMokB
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(872)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(872)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNewsMokB"
msgid "건물주 목씨 소재 파악 중… 관리실 비운 채 연락 끊겨"
msgstr "警方追查睦姓房東下落…管理室人去樓空，已失聯"

#. Key:	EpilogueNewsMokA
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(876)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(876)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNewsMokA"
msgid "경찰, 건물주 목씨 상대로 사건 경위 조사"
msgstr "警方約談睦姓房東，釐清案發經過"

#. Key:	EpilogueNews3Seen
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(885)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(885)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNews3Seen"
