#. Key:	EpilogueNews6Recorder
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(921)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(921)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNews6Recorder"
