#. Key:	EpilogueNews6Calendar
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(930)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(930)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNews6Calendar"
