msgstr "管理室牆上的月曆停在去年7月，26日那格做了記號"

#. Key:	EpilogueNews5Roster
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(942)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(942)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNews5Roster"
msgid "인근 편의점 직원은 사건 당일 야간 근무 중 들은 소리를 진술했다"
msgstr "附近便利商店店員向警方說明案發當天值夜班時聽到的聲音"

#. Key:	EpilogueNews5Parcel
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(950)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(950)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNews5Parcel"
msgid "인근 편의점 직원은 실종자의 택배를 건물주가 찾아갔다고 진술했다"
msgstr "附近便利商店店員指出，失蹤者的包裹是由房東領走"

#. Key:	EpilogueNews5
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(957)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(957)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNews5"
msgid "인근 편의점 직원의 목격 진술을 토대로 당시 행적을 확인 중이다"
msgstr "警方根據附近便利商店店員的目擊證詞，正在釐清當時的行蹤"

#. Key:	FifthDawnCaptionStart
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(314)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorFifthDawnDirector.cpp(314)
