msgid "401호 황순금 소리 일지"
msgstr "401室 黃順今 聲音日誌"

#. Key:	Journal1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(905)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(905)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Journal1"
msgid "7/27  네 시 반쯤 또 깸. 위에서 다섯 번. 관리실 전화 안 받음."
msgstr "7/27  四點半左右又醒。上面敲五下。管理室電話沒人接。"

#. Key:	Journal2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(906)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(906)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Journal2"
msgid "7/28  또 다섯 번. 어제보다 힘이 없음."
msgstr "7/28  又是五下。比昨天沒力。"

#. Key:	Journal3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(907)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(907)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Journal3"
msgid "7/29  벽이 하도 울어서 나도 두드려 줬다. 저쪽이 하던 대로 둘, 쉬고, 하나. 그랬더니 조용하데. 사람인가."
msgstr "7/29  牆一直響個不停，我也敲了回去。照那邊的敲法，兩下，停一下，再一下。結果就安靜了。是人嗎？"

#. Key:	Journal4
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(908)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(908)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Journal4"
msgid "7/30  네 번 들음. 수도 틀자 안 들림."
msgstr "7/30  聽到四下。開了水龍頭就聽不到了。"

#. Key:	Journal5
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(909)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(909)
